# Apple services that need a non-CN exit (🍏 苹果代理)
# Must load before apple.list / ACL4SSR Apple.list, which send all of apple.com /
# icloud.com DIRECT. Only region-gated services live here; APNs, iMessage, FaceTime,
# Apple ID, App Store, iCloud (incl. CN GCBD), updates and Apple Music stay DIRECT.
# PROCESS-NAME: Android package / Windows .exe / macOS bundle binary. iOS ignores it.

# Apple TV+ (not sold in CN; entitlement is checked by exit IP)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tv.apple.com
DOMAIN,tv.applemusic.com
DOMAIN,uts-api.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,np-edge.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,play-edge.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls-svod.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls-amt.itunes.apple.com
PROCESS-NAME,com.apple.atve.androidtv.appletv
PROCESS-NAME,AppleTV.exe
PROCESS-NAME,TV

# Apple News (not available in CN)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news
DOMAIN,news-edge.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-events.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-client.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-assets.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-client-search.apple.com
PROCESS-NAME,News

# Region check used by News / Apple Intelligence
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com

# Apple Intelligence Private Cloud Compute relays (ChatGPT extension hosts live in ai.list)
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com

# TestFlight (some betas are gated by exit-IP region)
DOMAIN,testflight.apple.com

# iCloud Private Relay ingress (non-CN Apple ID only; CN region has it disabled).
# While Relay is on, all Safari traffic rides inside these hosts and bypasses the
# CN / foreign split. Set 🍏 苹果代理 to DIRECT or REJECT if that is unwanted.
DOMAIN,mask.icloud.com
DOMAIN,mask-h2.icloud.com
DOMAIN,mask-api.icloud.com
